        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Parasol of chiffon and lace and with a wooden handle, England, 1890s"@en , "Parasol of black machine-made lace over chiffon and with a wooden handle. Trimmed with black and yellow satin ribbon to which is fixed a white machine-made applique embroidery. Half lined in yellow silk."@en ;
